# =============================================================================
# 040-no-experiments-pocket-sponsored.patch — PyreVixen: no Studies/Nimbus,
# no Pocket, no sponsored content
#
# WHAT THIS DOES
#   1. Nimbus/Studies: remote experiments can never be fetched or applied.
#      - BuildConfig.NIMBUS_ENDPOINT is forced to 'null' (both the .nimbus-file
#        branch and the localProperties branch).
#      - NimbusInterface.maybeFetchExperiments() (the only periodic-fetch call
#        site, invoked from FenixApplication) is a no-op.
#      - MessageNotificationWorker.tryFetchAndApplyNimbusExperiments() (the
#        background-fetch path) returns false immediately.
#   2. Pocket: the `homescreen` Nimbus feature's sections-enabled map defaults
#      pocket and pocket-sponsored-stories to false (variable default + nightly
#      channel default). This flows into Settings.homescreenSections, which
#      gates showPocketRecommendationsFeature / showPocketSponsoredStories,
#      which in turn gate PocketMiddleware's periodic refresh and
#      HomeFragment.initStoriesState — Pocket never phones home.
#   3. Sponsored tiles: Settings.showContileFeature defaults to false.
#
# VERIFIED AGAINST: FIREFOX-ANDROID_158_0_RELEASE (2026-10-14).
#   * Nimbus init lives in FenixApplication.initializeNimbus()
#     (FenixApplication.kt:726: components.nimbus.sdk + FxNimbus.initialize).
#     The fetch paths are: maybeFetchExperiments (experiments/NimbusSetup.kt:139,
#     called only from FenixApplication.kt:642), MessageNotificationWorker
#     tryFetchAndApplyNimbusExperiments (:246), SplashScreenOperation
#     applyPendingExperiments (:133, no-op when nothing was fetched), and the
#     manual Studies screen (StudiesInteractor.kt:34, user-triggered).
#   * Pocket gating chain (all verified): nimbus.fml.yaml `homescreen`
#     sections-enabled -> Settings.homescreenSections (utils/Settings.kt:321)
#     -> showPocketRecommendationsFeature (:198) / showPocketSponsoredStories
#     (:241) -> PocketMiddleware (:75-85) + HomeFragment.initStoriesState
#     (:1104). service-pocket is `implementation project(':components:service-pocket')`
#     (fenix/app/build.gradle:523).
#   * Sponsored Suggest / search suggestions are Gecko prefs, enforced via
#     config/default-prefs.js (outside patches/).
#
# DELIBERATE DEVIATIONS FROM THE FIRST DRAFT
#   * FenixApplication.initializeNimbus() is intentionally KEPT, not deleted.
#     ~40 Settings defaults read FxNimbus.features.*.value(), which requires
#     initialization to return the fml defaults; deleting it risks crashes that
#     cannot be verified without a build. The privacy boundary is the fetch
#     path, not the local-defaults lookup — and every fetch path is cut here.
#   * Pocket is disabled at the feature-flag level rather than by deleting the
#     service-pocket dependency: the dep removal would require synchronized
#     surgery in Core.kt (pocketStoriesService), Components.kt:340,
#     HomeActivity.kt:1004-1005, HomeFragment.kt (2 sites), HomeSettingsFragment.kt
#     (2 blocks + XML), and PocketMiddleware.kt. The flag kill achieves "never
#     phones home" in one hunk; the module remains as unreachable dead code for
#     a follow-up cleanup patch.
#   * The first draft's invented HomeFragment.bindHomeSections hunk is dropped
#     (no such method exists; the real binding is initStoriesState +
#     DefaultPocketStoriesController).
#
# CONFIDENCE
#   * All hunks CONFIDENT — contexts copied verbatim from the 158.0 tree,
#     verified with `git apply --check`.
#   * Post-build check: fresh profile shows no Pocket section, no sponsored
#     stories, no sponsored top sites; logcat shows no Nimbus fetch.
# =============================================================================

